# Project Context Index (CONTEXT.md)

> Curated `llms.txt`-style index for this project. One H1, a short summary, then
> annotated **inline** links into the `knowledge/` topic tree. Keep it under 150
> lines and ≈ one screen — push detail DOWN into `knowledge/*.md`, never inline.

This is the entry map to the project's structured knowledge. Each link points at an
atomic topic file (one subsystem / layer / bounded context per file). Decisions are
append-only ADRs under `knowledge/decisions/`.

